   ["Do you have any painkillers?","ඔයා ළඟ වේදනා නාශක තියෙනවද?","ef9a5855-5c1c-410b-bdcf-ab14fb36c925","e08adde7-3efd-409c-9854-ac257ae2256a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_sin:pod-1:SC10-S02": [
   ["Yes, they're down that aisle,","ඔව්, ඒවා ඔය මංතීරුවේ පහළින්,","763e0c59-5f16-4171-9639-11ad0d2460b6","fcec585c-3eb6-438d-ba81-fd17474537b4"],
