   ["And do you have any painkillers for children?","ඔයා ළඟ ළමයින්ට වේදනා නාශක තියෙනවද?","92a7c00c-c8e9-447d-b822-048ead6c3a43","078638af-c097-434c-8608-7475868b8138"]
  ],
  "eng_for_sin:pod-1:SC10-S04": [
