   ["but you'll have to look to make sure.","ඒත් විශ්වාස කරගන්න ඔයා බලන්න ඕනේ.","82613111-5337-40a3-ab31-a9c5c8584196","54682d08-e826-48aa-9f9d-aa848e3f558c"]
  ],
  "eng_for_sin:pod-1:SC10-S05": [
   ["I also need to get some sunscreen","මට අව්ව ආලේපයකුයි","8df4d983-9738-4680-b309-bafa3b4d4956","8a2d0c25-3a9f-4c03-a3bc-f4fd47eb282f"],
   ["and some toothpaste.","දන්තාලේපයකුයි ගන්නත් ඕනේ.","aee53ccf-1f3f-49d4-989c-96606684c866","22da17fc-829f-4459-a4c5-959bf4647c9c"]
  ],
  "eng_for_sin:pod-1:SC10-S06": [
   ["Sunscreen is down there on your right,","අව්ව ආලේපය ඔය පහළින් ඔයාගේ දකුණු පැත්තේ,","f3d54e12-858b-4a6a-86ea-2911127e1cb1","982c3773-ef20-4950-9c46-287943bd5464"],
   ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.","දන්තාලේපය ඔය කොනේ ඔයාට හම්බවෙයි.","e6b8c96d-d7c9-48e1-8e08-d816b98d60e2","d7b60fb2-8a84-4515-972a-370337e68dcf"]
  ],
  "eng_for_sin:pod-1:SC10-S07": [
   ["Thank you, you've been very helpful.","ස්තූතියි, ඔයා මට හරිම උදව්කාරයි.","73098d09-784b-4315-9ee0-5a72f5eb7497","c1701d81-aeef-4437-85c6-26c22752526c"],
   ["I'm very grateful.","මම හරිම කෘතඥයි.","183c9aab-6cc8-4ef7-a550-78a8a5054418","127bc64a-4b83-4b5b-a80b-f0b8cfb28513"]
  ],
  "eng_for_sin:pod-1:SC10-S08": [
